@startuml kairos-record-new-payment-sequence
title Record New Payment (Manual)

actor Admin
participant "Web Admin" as WebAdmin
participant "Kairos API" as API
participant "DB" as DB

Admin -> WebAdmin: Open "Record Payment" form
Admin -> WebAdmin: Enter details (member, branch, amount, type)\nClick "Save"
WebAdmin -> API: POST /finance/payments {data}
API -> DB: INSERT Payment
DB --> API: paymentId
API --> WebAdmin: 201 Created

WebAdmin --> Admin: Show "Payment recorded" confirmation

@enduml
